+Show Configuration
+------------------
+
+To print the loaded application's configuration as JSON, use the
+:func:`config <cli.config_command>` command. Any configuration keys containing
+``SECRET``, ``PASSWORD``, ``TOKEN``, or ``KEY`` will have their values masked as
+``"***"``. ::
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "ENV": "production",
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***",
+      ...
+    }
+
+
